		(property "Description" "Reverse-polarity protection P-MOSFET on the 5 V input: drain to 5V_IN (J1 pins 1/2), source to the 5V rail, gate to GND. Conducts with ~60 mohm when the supply is correct, blocks a reversed supply. D7 (SMAJ5.0A) clamps 5V_IN."
