		(property "Description" "J_SAI2 expansion header, 2x6: 1 GND, 2 GND, 3 MCLK, 4 GND, 5 BCLK, 6 GND, 7 LRCLK, 8 GND, 9 DIN (to core), 10 DOUT (from core), 11 3.3V_DIG, 12 5V. Clocks are buffered (U21) in both directions; the core is I2S master (SAI2_MODE=10) or slave (SAI2_MODE=01), chosen by firmware. MCLK is always sourced by the core."
